+/-- **Two threads in turn, to the end of the run**: `w` pairs of actions,
+then each thread only reads, `kP` and `kQ` actions; the work is all of
+these. -/
+theorem XMach.ends_sweeps {M : XMach S} {X : XNet S} {P Q : XThread S} {w kP kQ W : Nat}
